    {"type":"text","id":"mind_trigger","x":95,"y":280,"width":490,"height":24,"text":"trigger: event on bus → mind dispatcher spawns Claude Code","originalText":"trigger: event on bus → mind dispatcher spawns Claude Code","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":300005,"version":1,"versionNonce":300006,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"rectangle","id":"mind_steps","x":95,"y":315,"width":490,"height":300,"strokeColor":"#6d28d9","backgroundColor":"#ffffff","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":300007,"version":1,"versionNonce":300008,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[{"id":"mind_steps_t","type":"text"}],"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"mind_steps_t","x":105,"y":325,"width":470,"height":280,"text":"input: one event payload (or close-batched group)\n\n1. Decide which anchors / entities this event touches.\n    (identity handles = hints; agent decides actual match)\n2. Create new entities for non-anchored subjects.\n3. Update activated anchor layers (slow / mid / fast).\n    Precision-weighted: slow resists, fast updates readily.\n    Case base cites source IDs (gmail:msg_abc, etc.).\n4. Update relationship layers per-layer.\n    Each layer's precision tunes independently.\n5. For predictions (event / fact / pattern):\n     support → precision += (1 - p) * 0.1\n     contradict → precision -= p * 0.3\n     irrelevant → delete\n6. Query MCP servers when richer context is needed\n    (revisit Marcus's thread, look up calendar history).\n7. set_reminder(...) for future thoughts.\n8. Exit. Daemon handles next event.","originalText":"input: one event payload (or close-batched group)\n\n1. Decide which anchors / entities this event touches.\n    (identity handles = hints; agent decides actual match)\n2. Create new entities for non-anchored subjects.\n3. Update activated anchor layers (slow / mid / fast).\n    Precision-weighted: slow resists, fast updates readily.\n    Case base cites source IDs (gmail:msg_abc, etc.).\n4. Update relationship layers per-layer.\n    Each layer's precision tunes independently.\n5. For predictions (event / fact / pattern):\n     support → precision += (1 - p) * 0.1\n     contradict → precision -= p * 0.3\n     irrelevant → delete\n6. Query MCP servers when richer context is needed\n    (revisit Marcus's thread, look up calendar history).\n7. set_reminder(...) for future thoughts.\n8. Exit. Daemon handles next event.","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":300009,"version":1,"versionNonce":300010,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"mind_steps","lineHeight":1.4},
    {"type":"text","id":"mind_tools_label","x":95,"y":625,"width":490,"height":24,"text":"substrate-mcp[mind] tool catalog:","originalText":"substrate-mcp[mind] tool catalog:","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#6d28d9","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":300011,"version":1,"versionNonce":300012,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"mind_tools","x":95,"y":655,"width":490,"height":260,"text":"run_sql  (single read tool: anchors, entities,\n   subjects view, relationships, predictions,\n   plays, reminders)\nread_profile · list/read_playbook_section\n\ncreate_anchor · create_entity · promote_entity\nupdate_anchor_layer · update_anchor_meta · bump_anchor\nupdate_entity · bump_entity · delete_entity · delete_anchor\nupdate_identity_handles · cite\ncreate_relationship · update_relationship_layer · delete_relationship\ncreate_prediction · delete_prediction\nsupport_* / contradict_* precision\n   (anchor layer · relationship layer · prediction)\nset_reminder · cancel_reminder\n\nplus SDK-native MCP tools (per config.agents.mind.mcp_servers)\n\nNOT in allowlist:\n   write_* diary component family (diary only)\n   append_thinking_layer · emit_efference_prediction (diary only)\n   create_play (cold-start only)","originalText":"run_sql  (single read tool: anchors, entities,\n   subjects view, relationships, predictions,\n   plays, reminders)\nread_profile · list/read_playbook_section\n\ncreate_anchor · create_entity · promote_entity\nupdate_anchor_layer · update_anchor_meta · bump_anchor\nupdate_entity · bump_entity · delete_entity · delete_anchor\nupdate_identity_handles · cite\ncreate_relationship · update_relationship_layer · delete_relationship\ncreate_prediction · delete_prediction\nsupport_* / contradict_* precision\n   (anchor layer · relationship layer · prediction)\nset_reminder · cancel_reminder\n\nplus SDK-native MCP tools (per config.agents.mind.mcp_servers)\n\nNOT in allowlist:\n   write_* diary component family (diary only)\n   append_thinking_layer · emit_efference_prediction (diary only)\n   create_play (cold-start only)","fontSize":10,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":300013,"version":1,"versionNonce":300014,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"lineHeight":1.45},
