    {"type":"text","id":"diary_steps_t","x":645,"y":325,"width":470,"height":280,"text":"daemon guarantees pending events processed first\n(always-fresh via serialization)\n\n1. Read previous diaries as far back as useful\n    (run_sql over diary_components; no fixed window).\n2. Compose components per section:\n    • Sections: Right Now / On the Desk\n                       / Tracking / Background\n    • Templates: email-draft, calendar-block,\n                       choose-one, free-text-reply, charts, ...\n3. For each draft: produce, then validate against source\n    (query Gmail MCP for source thread).\n4. Emit efference-copy predictions on dispatchables.\n5. Append thinking-layer journal — flag promotion\n    candidates and substrate observations for the\n    mind agent.\n6. Persist via write_<template> tools (one per component).\n\nNo substrate writes. Promotion is the mind agent's job.","originalText":"daemon guarantees pending events processed first\n(always-fresh via serialization)\n\n1. Read previous diaries as far back as useful\n    (run_sql over diary_components; no fixed window).\n2. Compose components per section:\n    • Sections: Right Now / On the Desk\n                       / Tracking / Background\n    • Templates: email-draft, calendar-block,\n                       choose-one, free-text-reply, charts, ...\n3. For each draft: produce, then validate against source\n    (query Gmail MCP for source thread).\n4. Emit efference-copy predictions on dispatchables.\n5. Append thinking-layer journal — flag promotion\n    candidates and substrate observations for the\n    mind agent.\n6. Persist via write_<template> tools (one per component).\n\nNo substrate writes. Promotion is the mind agent's job.","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":400009,"version":1,"versionNonce":400010,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"diary_steps","lineHeight":1.4},
    {"type":"text","id":"diary_tools_label","x":635,"y":625,"width":490,"height":24,"text":"substrate-mcp[diary] tool catalog:","originalText":"substrate-mcp[diary] tool catalog:","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#047857","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":400011,"version":1,"versionNonce":400012,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"diary_tools","x":635,"y":655,"width":490,"height":260,"text":"reads via run_sql (same read surface as mind):\n   anchors · entities · subjects view · relationships\n   predictions · plays · past diary_* rows\n   read_profile · list/read_playbook_section\n\ndiary-only writes:\n   write_<template> family (one per HITL template)\n   clear_diary · delete_diary_component\n   append_thinking_layer\n   emit_efference_prediction (tied to dispatched component)\n\nplus SDK-native MCP tools (per config.agents.diary.mcp_servers)\n\nNOT in allowlist: every substrate write.\n   create_anchor / create_entity / promote_entity\n   delete_entity / update_anchor_layer / update_entity\n   update_relationship_layer · support_*/contradict_* precision\n   delete_prediction / delete_relationship\n   set_reminder / cancel_reminder\n\nSubstrate observations during composition → thinking layer.\nNext mind invocation reads and acts.\n\nNote: diary_act, diary_add_comment, diary_add_note\nare MCP tools the calling agent uses; their effects\narrive as events on subsequent cycles.","originalText":"reads via run_sql (same read surface as mind):\n   anchors · entities · subjects view · relationships\n   predictions · plays · past diary_* rows\n   read_profile · list/read_playbook_section\n\ndiary-only writes:\n   write_<template> family (one per HITL template)\n   clear_diary · delete_diary_component\n   append_thinking_layer\n   emit_efference_prediction (tied to dispatched component)\n\nplus SDK-native MCP tools (per config.agents.diary.mcp_servers)\n\nNOT in allowlist: every substrate write.\n   create_anchor / create_entity / promote_entity\n   delete_entity / update_anchor_layer / update_entity\n   update_relationship_layer · support_*/contradict_* precision\n   delete_prediction / delete_relationship\n   set_reminder / cancel_reminder\n\nSubstrate observations during composition → thinking layer.\nNext mind invocation reads and acts.\n\nNote: diary_act, diary_add_comment, diary_add_note\nare MCP tools the calling agent uses; their effects\narrive as events on subsequent cycles.","fontSize":10,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":400013,"version":1,"versionNonce":400014,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"lineHeight":1.45},
