    {"type":"text","id":"cs_steps_t","x":1185,"y":325,"width":470,"height":280,"text":"1. Read profile.md as user-authored seed.\n2. Seed_principal_anchor:\n     • slow layer extracted from profile prose\n     • precision starting band (0.5–0.8 per evidence)\n     • mid + fast empty\n     • identity_handles from profile\n3. Exit.\n\nThat's it.\nNo other anchors created.\nNo entities. No historical stream reading.\nNo backfill.\n\nDay 1 starts with one anchor.\nEvents arrive through normal flow.\nEntities emerge organically as observed.\nMind agent later promotes where warranted.","originalText":"1. Read profile.md as user-authored seed.\n2. Seed_principal_anchor:\n     • slow layer extracted from profile prose\n     • precision starting band (0.5–0.8 per evidence)\n     • mid + fast empty\n     • identity_handles from profile\n3. Exit.\n\nThat's it.\nNo other anchors created.\nNo entities. No historical stream reading.\nNo backfill.\n\nDay 1 starts with one anchor.\nEvents arrive through normal flow.\nEntities emerge organically as observed.\nMind agent later promotes where warranted.","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":500009,"version":1,"versionNonce":500010,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"cs_steps","lineHeight":1.4},
    {"type":"text","id":"cs_tools_label","x":1175,"y":625,"width":490,"height":24,"text":"substrate-mcp[cold-start] tool catalog:","originalText":"substrate-mcp[cold-start] tool catalog:","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":500011,"version":1,"versionNonce":500012,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"cs_tools","x":1175,"y":655,"width":490,"height":260,"text":"run_sql · read_profile · list/read_playbook_section\n\nfull mind write surface:\n   create_anchor · update_anchor_layer · create_entity\n   promote_entity · create_relationship · update_relationship_layer\n   create_prediction · support_*/contradict_* precision\n   cite · set_reminder\nplus create_play (cold-start only)\n\nHistory MCPs (email / calendar / notes) — scans a\n   7-30 day window to seed from observed history.\n\nOne bounded first pass: principal anchor + high-conviction\nanchors + long-tail entities + cadence predictions +\nreminders + persona plays, then exit.","originalText":"run_sql · read_profile · list/read_playbook_section\n\nfull mind write surface:\n   create_anchor · update_anchor_layer · create_entity\n   promote_entity · create_relationship · update_relationship_layer\n   create_prediction · support_*/contradict_* precision\n   cite · set_reminder\nplus create_play (cold-start only)\n\nHistory MCPs (email / calendar / notes) — scans a\n   7-30 day window to seed from observed history.\n\nOne bounded first pass: principal anchor + high-conviction\nanchors + long-tail entities + cadence predictions +\nreminders + persona plays, then exit.","fontSize":10,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":500013,"version":1,"versionNonce":500014,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"lineHeight":1.45},
