    {"type":"text","id":"footer","x":80,"y":950,"width":1600,"height":40,"text":"Cognitive state lives in SQLite (digest.db); event bus is the spine. Events are triggers, not memory. Always-fresh via mind dispatcher's serialized durable subscription. Execution lane (4th, not shown above): task.fired → execution dispatcher spawns Claude Code w/ external MCPs only (no substrate) → task.completed/failed re-enters mind queue.","originalText":"Cognitive state lives in SQLite (digest.db); event bus is the spine. Events are triggers, not memory. Always-fresh via mind dispatcher's serialized durable subscription. Execution lane (4th, not shown above): task.fired → execution dispatcher spawns Claude Code w/ external MCPs only (no substrate) → task.completed/failed re-enters mind queue.","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#1e40af","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":700001,"version":1,"versionNonce":700002,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"lineHeight":1.5}
  ],
